      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/viFR2tv6AXzCIIrvxGLJthhmc5U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24209-Absolute-Mexican-Cornbread-ddmfs-step-2-c3ae20bef49b489ebe6b8ce88c5df39e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24209/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in eggs one at a time.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/crHLNGEkd3OMpAWMaSakGuJmsRc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24209-Absolute-Mexican-Cornbread-ddmfs-step-3-e03bc65d8adf48bbaddb44f77eb2cdb9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24209/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend in corn, chiles, Monterey Jack cheese, and Cheddar cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pYN2P5mLVXhh-ITlKp4gqMHcD8I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24209-Absolute-Mexican-Cornbread-ddmfs-step-4-1a6b2f70e81942229f947c0149f97c16.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24209/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together flour, cornmeal, baking powder, and salt in a separate bowl. Add flour mixture to corn mixture; stir until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pzTn63M75g0f4TAwRD8o4By0pEQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-24209-Absolute-Mexican-Cornbread-ddmfs-step-5-02da001311f6436997eb404b3fef4879.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24209/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the prepared pan.",
